# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:3
translate italian welchsleepover_60772138:

    # sst "Good, let's get ready for bed then. I'm exhausted."
    sst "Bene, allora prepariamoci per andare a letto. Sono esausta."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:5
translate italian welchsleepover_324c58ca:

    # "We brush our teeth and get ready for bed, then lie together, holding each other close."
    "Ci laviamo i denti e ci prepariamo per andare a letto, poi ci sdraiamo insieme, abbracciati stretti."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:7
translate italian welchsleepover_fa86adb6:

    # sst "Wow... I really like this."
    sst "Wow... Mi piace davvero tanto."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:8
translate italian welchsleepover_85e75757:

    # pc "Yeah? Me too."
    pc "Davvero? Anche a me."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:9
translate italian welchsleepover_51f2ba34:

    # sst "I feel safe with you, like I haven't with any man in a long time."
    sst "Mi sento al sicuro con te, come non mi sentivo con nessun uomo da molto tempo."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:10
translate italian welchsleepover_309efed4:

    # pc "I'm glad. You are safe with me."
    pc "Ne sono felice. Con me sei al sicuro."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:12
translate italian welchsleepover_3a6deb7e:

    # sst "I think I'm starting to get feelings for you..."
    sst "Credo di iniziare a provare qualcosa per te..."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:13
translate italian welchsleepover_97a93af4:

    # sst "Like, more than just wanting-to-fuck-you feelings."
    sst "Cioè, qualcosa di più del semplice desiderio di scoparti."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:14
translate italian welchsleepover_eaa69a9a:

    # sst "We can talk about it more later, when I'm not so tired, but..."
    sst "Ne possiamo parlare meglio più tardi, quando non sarò così stanca, ma..."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:15
translate italian welchsleepover_8c55322f:

    # sst "It feels nice."
    sst "È una bella sensazione."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:18
translate italian welchsleepover_d41d8cd9:

    # voice 'voices/welch_goodnight1.mp3'
    voice 'voices/welch_goodnight1.mp3'

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:19
translate italian welchsleepover_a53d3b6c:

    # sst "Good night, [pcname]."
    sst "Buonanotte, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:20
translate italian welchsleepover_06ffce5e:

    # pc "Good night, Nora."
    pc "Buonanotte, Nora."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:23
translate italian welchsleepover_daeb21c6:

    # "I hold her close and fall asleep quickly, sleeping soundly through the night."
    "La stringo a me e mi addormento subito, dormendo profondamente per tutta la notte."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:26
translate italian welchsleepover_4b3ebb69:

    # "In the morning, I wake up with the sun shining in through the large windows of Nora's bedroom."
    "Al mattino, mi sveglio con il sole che splende attraverso le grandi finestre della camera da letto di Nora."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:27
translate italian welchsleepover_1bb89dc0:

    # "She's not in bed with me anymore, but I smell the scent of fresh coffee coming from downstairs."
    "Lei non è più a letto con me, ma sento il profumo del caffè fresco che sale dal piano di sotto."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:31
translate italian welchcoffee_b61ee1d9:

    # sst "Oh, good morning. I was just about to come up and wake you."
    sst "Oh, buongiorno. Stavo proprio per salire a svegliarti."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:32
translate italian welchcoffee_0d43b64c:

    # sst "I made coffee."
    sst "Ho preparato il caffè."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:35
translate italian welchcoffee_23486537:

    # sst "See, I'm not just a man-hating feminist."
    sst "Vedi, non sono solo una femminista che odia gli uomini."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:36
translate italian welchcoffee_6d96fe98:

    # sst "I can make coffee for a guy if he treats me right. And you treated me so good last night."
    sst "So preparare il caffè per un ragazzo se mi tratta bene. E tu mi hai trattata così bene ieri sera."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:39
translate italian welchcoffee_736796a9:

    # "We sit and drink coffee and chat for a bit."
    "Ci sediamo, beviamo il caffè e chiacchieriamo un po'."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:40
translate italian welchcoffee_0f3db852:

    # sst "This was really nice. I actually like waking up with you."
    sst "È stato davvero bello. Mi piace davvero svegliarmi con te."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:41
translate italian welchcoffee_51eed03e:

    # pc "I like waking up with you too, Nora."
    pc "Anche a me piace svegliarmi con te, Nora."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:42
translate italian welchcoffee_828e685e:

    # sst "Well, you can stay over any time you like. It's worth the risk."
    sst "Beh, puoi restare a dormire quando vuoi. Ne vale la pena."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:45
translate italian welchcoffee_550f71f3:

    # "When we finish our coffee, it's time for me to go."
    "Quando finiamo il caffè, è ora che io me ne vada."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:47
translate italian welchcoffee_98c3bb25:

    # sst "Have a good day, [pcname]. Let's do this again soon."
    sst "Buona giornata, [pcname]. Rifacciamolo presto."

# game/Scenes/Welch/welchsleepover.rpy:50
translate italian welchcoffee_6799ac6f:

    # "I get in my car and leave Nora's house to go on with the rest of my day."
    "Salgo in macchina e lascio la casa di Nora per continuare la mia giornata."

